 "じっせん": "تَدْرِيب (repetition of an activity to improve skill) / مُمَارَسَة (repetition of an activity to improve skill)  [practice]\nمثال: あなたが結婚し子供を持ったら、言葉より実践ということを悟るでしょう。\n→ When you get married and have kids, you'll realize that actions speak louder than words. / [praxis]",
