 "すぃません": "آسِف (Regretful or apologetic for one's actions.) / حَزِين (Grieved or saddened, especially by the loss of something or someone.) / مُؤْسِف, مُحْزِن (Poor, pitifully sad or regrettable.) / آسِف, آسِفَة (Expresses regret, remorse, or sorrow.)  [sorry]\nمثال: お邪魔だったらすいません。\n→ I am sorry if I disturbed you.",
