 "すいい": "تَحَوُّل, نَقِل (The process of change from one form, state, style or place to another.)  [transition]\nمثال: 企業倒産は先月も高水準に推移した。\n→ Corporate bankruptcies continued at a high level last month. / مَرَّرَ, مَرَّ (To change place.) / اِحْتَازَ (To change in state or status) / اِنْقَضَى, مَرَّ (To move through time.) / أَهمَلَ (To move through time.) / تَغَاضَى (To be accepted.) / تَخَلَّى (To refrain from doing something.) / طَريق (An opening, road, or track, available for passing; especially, one through or ov) / جَوَاز (Permission or license to pass, or to go and come.) / جَوَاز (A document granting permission to pass or to go and come; a passport; a ticket p)  [passing (of time)]",
 "すいいき": "مِيَاه (A body of water, almost always a river, sometimes a lake or reservoir, especiall) / سَقَى (To wet or supply with water; to moisten; to overflow with water; to irrigate.) / أَسْقَى, سَقَى (To wet or supply with water; to moisten; to overflow with water; to irrigate.)  [waters]\nمثال: 海の氷はきわめて変わりやすい――寒く風のない天候のときは固く凍っているが、嵐のときは外洋の広い水域で割れてしまう。\n→ The sea ice is highly variable - frozen solid during cold, calm weather and broken up in large areas of open water during storms.",
