 "すぎ": "مَاضٍ, الْمَاضِي (The period of time that has already happened, in contrast to the present and the) / مَاضٍ, الْمَاضِي (The past tense.) / مَاضٍ (Having already happened; in the past; finished.) / بَعْدَ (Beyond in place or quantity.)  [past]\nمثال: １０時過ぎには電話をしないで下さい。\n→ Don't call me up after ten o'clock. / أَيْضًا, كَذٰلِكَ (Likewise.) / أَكْثَرَ مِنَ اللّازِمِ, لِلْغايةِ (To an excessive degree, more than enough indicates that the degree of a quality )  [too (much)]\nمثال: スピードの出し過ぎは危険です。\n→ Driving too fast is dangerous.",
