 "すくい": "مُسَاعَدَة, مَعُونَة (Action given to provide assistance; aid.) / مُسَاعِد, مُسَاعِدَة (Something or someone which provides assistance with a task.) / سَاعَدَ, عَاوَنَ (To provide assistance to (someone or something).) / مُسَاعَدَة, النَّجْدَة (A cry of distress or an urgent request for assistance.)  [help]\nمثال: アフリカの難民が救いを求めている。\n→ Refugees in Africa are seeking help. / خَلَاص, تَطْهِير اَلنَّفْس (The process of being saved, the state of having been saved (from hell).)  [salvation] / خَلَاص, تَطْهِير اَلنَّفْس (The process of being saved, the state of having been saved (from hell).)  [(religious) salvation]\nمثال: 「神はわれらの救いである」と司祭は言った。\n→ \"God is our salvation,\" said the priest.",
