 "すげ替える": "تَبْدِيل, تَبَادُل (An act of exchanging or trading.) / بُورْصَة, تَدَاوُل (A place for conducting trading.) / تَبَادَلَ, صَرَفَ (To trade or barter.)  [to exchange]\nمثال: このままでは熾烈な情報戦に勝てない。ＣＩＯの首を挿げ替えよう。\n→ This is a bruising information war. At this rate we'll never come out on top. We've got to replace our CIO. / [to shift personnel ; to replace one person with another]",
