 "すっごい": "فَظِيع (Dreadful; causing terror, alarm and fear; awesome) / مُرْعِب (Formidable, powerful.) / مُرْعِب (Intense; extreme in degree or extent.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very unpleasant; disagreeable.) / فَظِيع, أَرْبَد (Very bad; lousy.)  [terrible] / مُدْهِش, مُذْهِل (Causing wonder and amazement; very surprising.)  [amazing (e.g. of strength)]\nمثال: すっごくいいものを見つけたよ！\n→ I've found something amazing! / شَاسِع, وَاسِع (Very large or wide (literally or figuratively).)  [vast (in numbers)]",
