 "すばやい": "سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick]\nمثال: 悪い知らせはすばやく伝わる。\n→ Bad news travels fast. / سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick (understanding, judgement, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は素早くフランス語を習得した。\n→ He acquired French quickly.",
