 "すり鉢状": "مَخْرُوطِيّ (Of or relating to a cone or cones.) / مَخْرُوطِيّ (Shaped like a cone.)  [conical]",
 "する": "فَعَلَ, عَمِلَ (To perform; to execute.) / دُو, دُو (A syllable used in solfège to represent the first and eighth tonic of a major sc)  [to do]\nمثال: 「これ以上何も言うことはありません、いいわけをするのはいやですから」と彼は言った。\n→ He said, \"I will say nothing more, because I hate making excuses.\" / فَعَلَ, صَنَعَ (To create.) / جَعَلَ (To cause to be.) / جَعَلَ (To force to do.) / جَعَلَ (To indicate or suggest to be.)  [to make (into)]\nمثال: それらはあなたを暖かくするのに役立つでしょう。\n→ They will help you to get warm. / [to serve as ; to act as]\nمثال: 頭痛を言い訳にして、彼は早く帰った。\n→ He used a headache as an excuse for leaving early. / لَبِسَ (to have on (clothes or accessories)) / اِرْتَدَى (to have on (clothes or accessories)) / اِهْتِراء (Damage to the appearance and/or strength of an item caused by use over time.)  [to wear (clothes, a facial expression, etc.)]\nمثال: そんな苦虫を噛みつぶしたような顔するなよ。\n→ Don't make such a sour face.",
 "するってえと": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]\nfrom Edo period 下町 speech",
 "するてえと": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]\nfrom Edo period 下町 speech",
 "すると": "آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [(and) then]\nمثال: スージーは真夜中までおきていた。すると奇妙な物音が聞こえた。\n→ Susie sat up until midnight, when she heard a strange noise. / آنَذَاكَ, حِينَئِذٍ (At that time.) / ثُمَّ (Soon afterward.) / ثُمَّ (Next in order of place.) / إِذًا, إِذَنْ (In that case.)  [then]",
